WEBVTT

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:07.369
Okay, all stretched.
Let's go. Quickly.

00:00:07.469 --> 00:00:09.071
Quick, quick, quick, quick,
quick, quick, quick.

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.538
(sighs) Okay. Coast is clear.

00:00:10.639 --> 00:00:13.274
- (screams, gasps)
- (cans clattering)

00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:15.044
Uh... oh.

00:00:15.143 --> 00:00:16.411
(gasps)

00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:17.980
- You!
- (products drop to floor)

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.849
(chuckles nervously)

00:00:19.949 --> 00:00:21.583
You did this to me!

00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:22.717
You fraud.

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:24.586
Come on, girls.
Clean up on aisle nine!

00:00:24.686 --> 00:00:26.721
(chuckles)
I've always wanted to say that.

00:00:26.821 --> 00:00:28.556
Just hide over here.

00:00:29.424 --> 00:00:31.127
- What does that lady want?
- (panting)

00:00:31.226 --> 00:00:33.062
Lady? I didn't see a lady.

00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:35.563
- ("Terminator 2" theme plays)
- (yells)

00:00:35.664 --> 00:00:37.365
(gasps) Lady!

00:00:37.465 --> 00:00:39.001
- Come on, let's go.
- (Agnes yelps, Edith grunts)

00:00:39.101 --> 00:00:40.870
- Faster.
- Aah! -Whoa!

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:42.570
You're no hairdresser!

00:00:42.671 --> 00:00:45.473
- (Lucy and shopper whimper)
- I'm onto you!

00:00:45.573 --> 00:00:47.809
- Get back here!
- Got to get out of here.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.377
(grunts)

00:00:53.082 --> 00:00:54.416
(whimpers)

00:00:57.252 --> 00:00:59.220
- (screams)
- (yells)

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.723
(whimpers, screams)

00:01:03.258 --> 00:01:04.325
(muffled whimper)

00:01:04.426 --> 00:01:06.594
(panting):
Okay.

00:01:07.629 --> 00:01:08.931
(yelps)

00:01:09.031 --> 00:01:10.665
- (growls)
- (screams)

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:13.002
(yelling)

00:01:13.102 --> 00:01:14.103
Come back here!

00:01:14.202 --> 00:01:15.403
(yelps, whimpers)

00:01:15.503 --> 00:01:17.272
- AGNES (laughing): Whoa!
- (Edith giggling)

00:01:17.372 --> 00:01:19.574
(shoppers yelling)

00:01:19.674 --> 00:01:22.811
- Hey! No, no, no, no, no!
- (girls whooping)

00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:24.914
- You can't just... (grunts)
- LUCY: Open! Open!

00:01:25.014 --> 00:01:26.648
- Open!
- (girls scream)

00:01:27.282 --> 00:01:29.684
(all screaming)

00:01:30.719 --> 00:01:32.353
(grunts)

00:01:33.089 --> 00:01:34.723
Whoa!

00:01:34.823 --> 00:01:36.025
Let's go.

00:01:36.125 --> 00:01:37.893
(engine starts)

00:01:37.993 --> 00:01:40.196
(engine revs, tires squeal)

00:01:40.295 --> 00:01:42.764
Stop! Come here, you!

00:01:42.865 --> 00:01:44.900
(panting)

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.002
(sobbing):
No!

00:01:47.103 --> 00:01:48.336
Whew.

00:01:48.436 --> 00:01:49.839
That was a close one.

00:01:49.939 --> 00:01:52.240
Always a fun time
when you go shopping with Mom.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.210
- Yeah!
- Best shopping trip ever!

00:01:54.309 --> 00:01:56.611
AGNES:
I feel so alive!

00:01:56.711 --> 00:01:58.680
♪

00:02:01.083 --> 00:02:02.751
(meows)

00:02:03.384 --> 00:02:06.621
(electronic dance theme playing)

00:02:07.822 --> 00:02:09.791
("Through the Fire and Flames"
by DragonForce playing)

00:02:09.892 --> 00:02:11.793
(cat moaning)

00:02:27.542 --> 00:02:29.410
- (music stops)
- ANNOUNCER: Perfecto.

00:02:29.511 --> 00:02:31.346
- (meows)
- GRU (over speaker): Poppy?

00:02:31.446 --> 00:02:33.949
- (gasps)
- Poppy!

00:02:34.049 --> 00:02:35.784
(meows)

00:02:37.352 --> 00:02:38.988
I don't see her, Junior.

00:02:39.088 --> 00:02:40.588
POPPY:
Look up, genius.

00:02:40.688 --> 00:02:42.057
- Huh?
- (over speaker): You're late.

00:02:42.158 --> 00:02:43.391
(groans)

00:02:43.491 --> 00:02:45.460
How do I get up there?

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:46.996
POPPY (over speaker):
Use the trampoline.

00:02:47.096 --> 00:02:48.696
Huh?

00:02:52.134 --> 00:02:53.169
(sighs)

00:02:53.269 --> 00:02:55.403
Here we go.

00:02:56.205 --> 00:02:57.705
(pants, grunts)

00:02:57.806 --> 00:02:59.175
(straining)

00:02:59.275 --> 00:03:01.076
- (Gru Jr. giggling)
- (yelps)

00:03:01.177 --> 00:03:03.112
(panting)

00:03:03.212 --> 00:03:04.847
Whoa! Aah!

00:03:04.947 --> 00:03:06.581
(screams, strains)

00:03:06.681 --> 00:03:08.150
- (groaning)
- (Gru Jr. laughs)

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.418
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:03:11.153 --> 00:03:13.055
(Gru straining)

00:03:13.155 --> 00:03:15.456
(Gru Jr. laughing)

00:03:16.825 --> 00:03:18.827
(grunts, groans)

00:03:22.363 --> 00:03:24.099
POPPY:
It is I,

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.434
Poppy Prescott,

00:03:26.534 --> 00:03:28.736
- villainess.
- (meows)

00:03:28.838 --> 00:03:30.206
Have a seat, Gru.

00:03:30.306 --> 00:03:32.308
All right, I'll sit... (grunts)

00:03:32.407 --> 00:03:33.909
- (cat meowing)
- (Gru Jr. laughing)

00:03:34.009 --> 00:03:35.643
Okay. Why am I here?

00:03:35.743 --> 00:03:40.415
Because, like you,
I was born to be bad.

00:03:40.515 --> 00:03:41.749
- And now...
- (knuckles crack)

00:03:41.851 --> 00:03:45.420
it's time to discuss
our big heist.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.056
(scoffs)
"Heist."

00:03:47.156 --> 00:03:48.891
Please, you're just a child.

00:03:48.991 --> 00:03:50.625
(grunting)

00:03:50.725 --> 00:03:53.095
All great villains start young.

00:03:53.195 --> 00:03:56.165
Didn't you steal the
Crown Jewels when you were 12?

00:03:56.265 --> 00:03:57.233
(Gru Jr. laughing)

00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:58.666
I was a lot younger than that.

00:03:58.766 --> 00:04:00.568
And no offense,
but you're not me.

00:04:00.668 --> 00:04:04.907
Oh, I plan on being
a lot better than you.

00:04:05.007 --> 00:04:07.309
Check this out.

00:04:07.408 --> 00:04:09.711
Hey, is that my old school?

00:04:09.811 --> 00:04:11.146
Bingo.

00:04:11.247 --> 00:04:15.317
Which I have expertly modeled
with glue and Popsicle sticks.

00:04:15.416 --> 00:04:18.187
And it's where
we are going to steal...

00:04:18.287 --> 00:04:20.956
the school mascot.

00:04:21.056 --> 00:04:22.958
You want to steal Lenny?

00:04:23.058 --> 00:04:24.392
- Exactly.
- (cat meows)

00:04:24.492 --> 00:04:27.229
Lycee Pas Bon has always been
my dream school,

00:04:27.329 --> 00:04:28.596
and this heist
will look so great

00:04:28.696 --> 00:04:30.498
on my villain transcripts.

00:04:30.598 --> 00:04:32.567
That is a terrible idea.

00:04:32.667 --> 00:04:35.536
Have you ever even seen
a honey badger?

00:04:35.637 --> 00:04:37.873
They are vicious
little monsters.

00:04:37.973 --> 00:04:42.011
They literally eat bees
and cobras for breakfast.

00:04:42.111 --> 00:04:44.280
Honey badger don't care.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.581
No way. No way am I helping you.

00:04:46.681 --> 00:04:48.951
Well, that's the thing
with blackmail.

00:04:49.051 --> 00:04:50.152
(Gru Jr. coos)

00:04:50.252 --> 00:04:51.854
You kind of have no choice.

00:04:51.954 --> 00:04:53.322
(Gru Jr. laughing)

00:04:53.421 --> 00:04:55.790
♪

00:04:58.093 --> 00:05:00.428
(Minions laughing)

00:05:06.634 --> 00:05:08.370
Come here. Come here!

00:05:08.469 --> 00:05:10.705
(speaking Minionese, grunting)

00:05:12.107 --> 00:05:14.442
(straining)

00:05:18.513 --> 00:05:20.916
(speaks Minionese, chuckles)

00:05:21.016 --> 00:05:23.852
- (speaking Minionese)
- (sirens wailing)

00:05:25.687 --> 00:05:27.588
Ah, uh... (speaks Minionese)
Tim.

00:05:27.689 --> 00:05:29.224
Tim, uh, tu le do it.

00:05:29.325 --> 00:05:31.427
- Go, go, go.
- P-P-Porque meo?

00:05:31.526 --> 00:05:33.162
(continues in Minionese)

00:05:33.262 --> 00:05:34.830
(whimpers) Chihuahua.

00:05:34.930 --> 00:05:36.432
(distant bang,
someone screaming)

00:05:36.531 --> 00:05:37.866
(all gasping, whimpering)

00:05:37.967 --> 00:05:40.302
(frightened chatter
in Minionese)

00:05:40.402 --> 00:05:42.371
Bas enough!
(continues in Minionese)

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.406
No! Tu le stronga.

00:05:44.505 --> 00:05:46.008
Tu le forta.

00:05:46.108 --> 00:05:47.176
Tu le besta!

00:05:47.276 --> 00:05:48.277
(continues in Minionese)

00:05:48.377 --> 00:05:49.445
Les salami!

00:05:49.544 --> 00:05:51.380
OTHERS:
Les salami!

00:05:51.479 --> 00:05:54.083
Aah! Suppository!

00:05:55.117 --> 00:05:56.818
(laughter)

00:05:56.919 --> 00:05:58.387
♪

00:05:58.486 --> 00:06:00.155
- (grunts)
- (gasps)

00:06:00.255 --> 00:06:01.423
Hey! Police!

00:06:01.522 --> 00:06:02.992
No problemo.

00:06:03.092 --> 00:06:04.659
(grunts)

00:06:04.759 --> 00:06:07.495
(metal rod whooshing
through air)

00:06:10.299 --> 00:06:12.301
- (grunts)
- Ooh. Uh...

00:06:12.401 --> 00:06:14.903
Piña colada.

00:06:16.604 --> 00:06:18.173
(gasps, yelps)

00:06:18.273 --> 00:06:20.075
(screaming)

00:06:21.176 --> 00:06:22.510
- MAN: Help!
- (gasps)

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.779
(shouts in Minionese)

00:06:25.513 --> 00:06:26.781
Please, can you help me?

00:06:26.882 --> 00:06:29.084
- Oh, si, si. (grunts)
- (whimpers)

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:32.021
(vocalizing an upbeat melody)

00:06:35.424 --> 00:06:37.192
Hey. All is goot.

00:06:37.292 --> 00:06:38.394
Ciao!

00:06:38.494 --> 00:06:39.895
(whimpers)

00:06:39.995 --> 00:06:41.363
(meows)

00:06:41.463 --> 00:06:43.098
Smudge, Smudge, come down.

00:06:43.198 --> 00:06:44.599
Hey! (speaks Minionese)

00:06:46.135 --> 00:06:47.436
(meows)

00:06:47.535 --> 00:06:48.569
(grunts)

00:06:48.669 --> 00:06:50.839
- Les gato. (chuckles)
- (gasps)

00:06:50.939 --> 00:06:53.108
- Thank you. Thank you.
- (startled grunting)

00:06:54.443 --> 00:06:56.078
Ooh, smoocha.

00:06:56.178 --> 00:06:57.312
(giggling)

00:06:57.413 --> 00:06:58.914
Oh!

00:06:59.014 --> 00:06:59.982
(yowls)

00:07:00.082 --> 00:07:03.052
- (muttering in Minionese)
- (people screaming)

00:07:03.152 --> 00:07:04.153
(alarm blaring)

00:07:04.253 --> 00:07:05.287
(straining)

00:07:05.387 --> 00:07:06.922
(grunts, yelps)

00:07:08.157 --> 00:07:09.491
Help!

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.227
MEGA TIM:
Bazooka!

00:07:12.327 --> 00:07:14.629
(grunting)

00:07:15.763 --> 00:07:18.699
- (straining)
- (metal screeching)

00:07:22.404 --> 00:07:24.406
- (sighs)
- (passengers cheering)

00:07:24.506 --> 00:07:26.241
(whooshing, crashing)

00:07:26.341 --> 00:07:28.709
(grunting)

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.113
Ah. Uh... (chuckles nervously)

